+          // ---- problem/rt_kappa_hsmooth: chi -> its horizontal mean over one photon
+          // mean free path.  See the long note at the top of this file for why this is
+          // an ARITHMETIC average of chi, why it touches nothing but the extinction,
+          // and why the deep interior is left bitwise alone.
+          if (ngh_hs > 0) {
+            if (rt_khs_ptr == nullptr) {
